# Recruitzaa — React Frontend Architecture Plan (v3 — Final)

> **Authored by**: Senior Frontend Architect (10 YOE perspective)
> **Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Redux Toolkit + TanStack Query + React Router v6 + Vite
> **Auth**: Firebase (Google OAuth + Email/Password)
> **Scope**: 4-Portal SPA — Public + Candidate + Employer + Super Admin
> **Design**: Mobile-First Responsive + Modern Corporate (Adecco-reference)
> **Reference UIs**: ui-ux-prototype HTML screens + adecco.com/employers

---

## Four Portals — Full Platform Architecture

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                        RECRUITZAA PLATFORM                                   │
│                                                                              │
│   PUBLIC            CANDIDATE             EMPLOYER           SUPER ADMIN     │
│   ──────────        ──────────────        ────────────       ────────────    │
│   /                 /candidate/*          /employer/*        /admin/*        │
│   /jobs             Dashboard             Dashboard          Dashboard       │
│   /jobs/:id         AI Hub                Post Job           Job Approvals   │
│   /auth             Kanban                Candidates         Company Mgmt    │
│   /employers        Profile               Analytics          User Mgmt       │
│   /about                                  Enquiry Form       Platform Stats  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
         ↕ Firebase Auth (role: CANDIDATE | EMPLOYER | SUPER_ADMIN)
                     ↕ REST API Backend
                     ↕ OpenAI API
```

---

## Role System

| Role | Firebase Custom Claim | Access |
|---|---|---|
| `CANDIDATE` | `role: "CANDIDATE"` | Candidate Portal + Public |
| `EMPLOYER` | `role: "EMPLOYER"` | Employer Portal + Public |
| `SUPER_ADMIN` | `role: "SUPER_ADMIN"` | Admin Panel (full access) |
| _(unauthenticated)_ | — | Public site only |

