## Final Tech Stack

| Layer | Library | Version | Rationale |
|---|---|---|---|
| Build | **Vite** | 5.x | Fastest HMR, optimized prod build |
| Framework | **React** | 18.x (TypeScript strict) | Concurrent features |
| Routing | **React Router** | v6.x | Nested routes, lazy loading, guards |
| Global State | **Redux Toolkit** | 2.x | Auth/UI/notification state |
| Server State | **TanStack Query** | v5.x | Caching, pagination, optimistic updates |
| Auth | **Firebase SDK** | v10.x | Google OAuth + Email/Password |
| HTTP | **Axios** | 1.x | Firebase token interceptor |
| Forms | **React Hook Form + Zod** | latest | Perf forms + schema validation |
| Data Tables | **TanStack Table** | v8.x | Headless, sort/filter/paginate, custom CSS |
| Drag & Drop | **@dnd-kit/core** | latest | Kanban board |
| Icons | **Lucide React** | latest | MIT, tree-shakeable |
| SEO | **react-helmet-async** | latest | Per-page meta tags, OG, title |
| Animations | **framer-motion** | 11.x | Page transitions, micro-animations |
| File Upload | **react-dropzone** | latest | PDF/DOCX validation |
| Date | **date-fns** | 3.x | Formatting, relative time |
| AI/OpenAI | **openai** SDK | 4.x | Streaming chat + ATS |
| Styling | **CSS Modules + CSS Variables** | — | Zero runtime, design token driven |
| Testing | **Vitest + RTL** | latest | Vite-native |
| Quality | ESLint + Prettier + Husky | (existing) | Already configured |

> ⚠️ **No Bootstrap. No Material UI. No Ant Design.** Full custom CSS.

