## Job Lifecycle Workflow (Critical Business Logic)

```
EMPLOYER                    SUPER ADMIN                 CANDIDATE
   │                             │                          │
   │  POST /api/jobs/            │                          │
   │──────────────────────────>  │                          │
   │  status: "PENDING"          │                          │
   │                             │                          │
   │                     GET /admin/job-approvals/          │
   │                     [Job appears in review queue]      │
   │                             │                          │
   │                     Review job details                 │
   │                             │                          │
   │                    ┌────────┴─────────┐               │
   │               APPROVE              REJECT              │
   │           PATCH status:          PATCH status:         │
