## Firebase Auth Flow (LLD)

```
Google OAuth:
  GoogleAuthProvider.signInWithPopup()
    → Firebase: { uid, email, displayName, photoURL }
    → POST /api/auth/verify/  { idToken }
    → Backend: verify token, get/create user, return { role, profile }
    → dispatch authSlice.setUser({ firebaseUser, role, profile })
    → navigate to /candidate/dashboard OR /employer/dashboard

Email/Password Register:
  createUserWithEmailAndPassword()
    → POST /api/auth/register/ { idToken, role: "CANDIDATE"|"EMPLOYER", name, phone }
    → Backend: set Firebase custom claim (role)
    → navigate to relevant dashboard

Token Refresh:
  Axios request interceptor:
    → firebase.auth().currentUser?.getIdToken(forceRefresh=false)
    → if 401: getIdToken(forceRefresh=true) → retry once
```

