## Mobile-First Responsive Strategy

| Component | Mobile (<768px) | Tablet (768–1024px) | Desktop (>1024px) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Navbar | Hamburger drawer | Compact, no mega | Full mega-menu |
| Sidebar | Slide-in drawer | Icon-only collapsible | Fixed 260px |
| Job Filters | Bottom sheet drawer | Collapsible sidebar | Always-visible left panel |
| Kanban | Horizontal scroll, touch-drag | 3 cols + scroll | All 5 cols |
| Auth Page | Form only (brand panel hidden) | 40/60 split | 50/50 split |
| Employer Landing | Stacked sections | 2-col grids | 4-col grids |
| Admin Tables | Scrollable, priority columns | Most columns | All columns + actions |

**iOS Safari rules**: 44px min touch targets, `env(safe-area-inset-*)`, no `position:fixed` traps, `-webkit-` prefixes where needed.

